    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11334","source":"Well cared-for adult chickens lay eggs every day.","translation":"受到良好照顧的成年雞每天都會下蛋。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11335","source":"Lives in the coop.","translation":"住在雞舍裡。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11337","source":"Happy adults lay duck eggs every other day.","translation":"快樂的成年鴨每隔一天會下一顆鴨蛋。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11340","source":"These are woolly rabbits! They shed precious wool every few days.","translation":"這些兔子毛茸茸的！每隔幾天就會掉落珍貴的兔毛。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11343","source":"Adults can be milked daily. A milk pail is required to harvest the milk.","translation":"成年乳牛每天都能擠奶。採集牛奶需要一個擠奶桶。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11344","source":"Lives in the barn.","translation":"住在畜棚裡。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11346","source":"These pigs are trained to find truffles!","translation":"這些豬受過尋找松露的訓練！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11349","source":"Happy adults provide goat milk every other day. A milk pail is required to harvest the milk.","translation":"快樂的成年山羊每隔一天可以擠出山羊奶。採集羊奶需要一個擠奶桶。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"PurchaseAnimalsMenu.cs.11352","source":"Adults can be shorn for wool. Sheep who form a close bond with their owners can grow wool faster. A pair of shears is required to harvest the wool.","translation":"成年綿羊可以剪取羊毛。和主人關係親密的綿羊會更快長出羊毛。採集羊毛需要一把剪刀。"},
